(4396012, 632906, 88204, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot! Great characther in the faces. I like that yellow is not your subject but it ties the image together... repeating elements, repeating color. Warm lighting is very nice. The yellow really pops. I like that the rest of the colors are muted. I''d prefer that all three faces were in sharp focus but it still works this way. Did you pose the men and give them the turbines to wear or did you somehow come across this absolutely perfect scenario??? Awesome shot! 10 from me!</td>', 'Amazing shot! Great characther in the faces. I like that yellow is not your subject but it ties the image together... repeating elements, repeating color. Warm lighting is very nice. The yellow really pops. I like that the rest of the colors are muted. I''d prefer that all three faces were in sharp focus but it still works this way. Did you pose the men and give them the turbines to wear or did you somehow come across this absolutely perfect scenario??? Awesome shot! 10 from me!', '2008-01-16 06:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
