(4396613, 633266, 88656, '<td valign="top">IMO I think that the green stem part of the flower should be more in focus. I really like the picture though. Gerberas are one of my favorite flowers!</td>', 'IMO I think that the green stem part of the flower should be more in focus. I really like the picture though. Gerberas are one of my favorite flowers!', '2008-01-16 11:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
