(4396664, 633842, 88241, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2008-01-16 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396668, 632204, 88656, '<td valign="top">I love how you showed that there is just a random yellow house among a ton of tan ones that all look alike! Good picture!</td>', 'I love how you showed that there is just a random yellow house among a ton of tan ones that all look alike! Good picture!', '2008-01-16 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396670, 633799, 69691, '<td valign="top">Good subject for this challenge. This looks like a very interesting light. A couple things to consider. Maybe putting this light into an interesting environment would have been good rather then using a simple black background. If this was not a possibility then maybe using a white background would have been better because the lamps base is black so you loose it in the background which is also black. Also i can see that the highlights were blown out. That is something that you should always pay close attention to.</td>', 'Good subject for this challenge. This looks like a very interesting light. A couple things to consider. Maybe putting this light into an interesting environment would have been good rather then using a simple black background. If this was not a possibility then maybe using a white background would have been better because the lamps base is black so you loose it in the background which is also black. Also i can see that the highlights were blown out. That is something that you should always pay close attention to.', '2008-01-16 11:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396675, 633915, 56826, '<td valign="top">10  Nicely done</td>', '10  Nicely done', '2008-01-16 11:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396678, 631257, 56826, '<td valign="top">Gave ya a 9. ;)</td>', 'Gave ya a 9. ;)', '2008-01-16 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396684, 633536, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the focus of the flame, and the definition of the hand.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the focus of the flame, and the definition of the hand.  Nicely done!', '2008-01-16 11:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396685, 633724, 84438, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting in this.</td>', 'Love the lighting in this.', '2008-01-16 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396688, 632678, 39679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot quite a bit.  I like the perspective - it gives the photo a real sense of movement and the boarder between the sky and the rocks adds a kind of cool surrealism.  However, it looks like the image is either just slightly overexposed or the yellows on the rocks is over-saturated.  Also, there is considerable noise in the sky.<br/> <br/>All that said, I really do like this shot and would love to see you re-work it a little.</td>', 'I like this shot quite a bit.  I like the perspective - it gives the photo a real sense of movement and the boarder between the sky and the rocks adds a kind of cool surrealism.  However, it looks like the image is either just slightly overexposed or the yellows on the rocks is over-saturated.  Also, there is considerable noise in the sky. All that said, I really do like this shot and would love to see you re-work it a little.', '2008-01-16 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396690, 633700, 84438, '<td valign="top">A nicely done photo!  The yellow aspect of the photo doesn''t jump out at me though..  There''s actually more blue in the photo than yellow.</td>', 'A nicely done photo!  The yellow aspect of the photo doesn''t jump out at me though..  There''s actually more blue in the photo than yellow.', '2008-01-16 11:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396692, 633121, 84438, '<td valign="top">The light is nice, but the pepper looks a little blown out..  Or at least it is lacking in definition.  A very appealing photo though.</td>', 'The light is nice, but the pepper looks a little blown out..  Or at least it is lacking in definition.  A very appealing photo though.', '2008-01-16 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396699, 633419, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I think it would be even more striking if the skin was higher key, by adding a brighter light to it..  It would be whiter and make the yellow line stand out even more!</td>', 'Nice!  I think it would be even more striking if the skin was higher key, by adding a brighter light to it..  It would be whiter and make the yellow line stand out even more!', '2008-01-16 11:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396704, 632488, 84438, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo..  The colour balance seems to be very artificial, which has put a lot of red in with the yellow.  I don''t find the processing to be as appealing as it could be.</td>', 'Interesting photo..  The colour balance seems to be very artificial, which has put a lot of red in with the yellow.  I don''t find the processing to be as appealing as it could be.', '2008-01-16 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396706, 632937, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The yellow colour could use a little more punch to it to make it really stand out.</td>', 'Nice.  The yellow colour could use a little more punch to it to make it really stand out.', '2008-01-16 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396708, 633325, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and execution.  Originality scores extra points.</td>', 'Very nice idea and execution.  Originality scores extra points.', '2008-01-16 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396713, 631954, 39679, '<td valign="top">Still life''s are tough and doing them well is normally about isolating your subject.  In this case, putting a uniform color behind the banana''s would really have helped.  The way it''s shot, I find myself distracted by the background and being very aware that this was just shot in a kitchen.</td>', 'Still life''s are tough and doing them well is normally about isolating your subject.  In this case, putting a uniform color behind the banana''s would really have helped.  The way it''s shot, I find myself distracted by the background and being very aware that this was just shot in a kitchen.', '2008-01-16 11:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396715, 632377, 84438, '<td valign="top">The lighting could definately be better.  The beans really lack definition.  I like the idea of the contrast between the green beans and the yellow though.</td>', 'The lighting could definately be better.  The beans really lack definition.  I like the idea of the contrast between the green beans and the yellow though.', '2008-01-16 11:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396717, 633847, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very unique!  Nice and simple.</td>', 'Very unique!  Nice and simple.', '2008-01-16 11:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396719, 633805, 69691, '<td valign="top">a good looking lady in a nice yellow dress great idea for a photo. A couple thing to consider though. Maybe bringing the model to a nice sandy part of the beach would have been nice. The title of this photo is isolated even though there are a bunch of people in the background. If you wanted to isolate this subject which would have been more effective then you should have maybe asked the person if they wouldn''t have minded going to a more quite place on the beach. Also the highlights in the wave are completely blown out. I don''t know what kind of camera was used but it seems like the photo was maybe taken on a low res mode because it is very pixely. Please don''t get upset i am just trying to give you some information to go by to maybe improve your images a bit more.</td>', 'a good looking lady in a nice yellow dress great idea for a photo. A couple thing to consider though. Maybe bringing the model to a nice sandy part of the beach would have been nice. The title of this photo is isolated even though there are a bunch of people in the background. If you wanted to isolate this subject which would have been more effective then you should have maybe asked the person if they wouldn''t have minded going to a more quite place on the beach. Also the highlights in the wave are completely blown out. I don''t know what kind of camera was used but it seems like the photo was maybe taken on a low res mode because it is very pixely. Please don''t get upset i am just trying to give you some information to go by to maybe improve your images a bit more.', '2008-01-16 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396722, 632917, 84438, '<td valign="top">Lighting is great, colours are nice.  I wonder what this would look like with a longer frame horizontally, and the glass in the last 1/3 of the frame?  Just a thought.</td>', 'Lighting is great, colours are nice.  I wonder what this would look like with a longer frame horizontally, and the glass in the last 1/3 of the frame?  Just a thought.', '2008-01-16 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396724, 633854, 84438, '<td valign="top">A very nice winter scene.  The yellow sign doesn''t stand out like it should though..  It doesn''t seem as sharp as it could be, and it would probably look better if it had some lighting..  Even a direct flash on it would probably make it pop.</td>', 'A very nice winter scene.  The yellow sign doesn''t stand out like it should though..  It doesn''t seem as sharp as it could be, and it would probably look better if it had some lighting..  Even a direct flash on it would probably make it pop.', '2008-01-16 11:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396729, 633867, 84438, '<td valign="top">Now that is just wrong. :)  Definate points for originality and humour, and the photo is actually very nicely done.</td>', 'Now that is just wrong. :)  Definate points for originality and humour, and the photo is actually very nicely done.', '2008-01-16 11:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396732, 633062, 84438, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice of composition.  It''s very nice, but the lighting could be a bit more diffuse.  The shine on the lemon looks blown.</td>', 'An interesting choice of composition.  It''s very nice, but the lighting could be a bit more diffuse.  The shine on the lemon looks blown.', '2008-01-16 11:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396735, 631038, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very appealing.  Nice natural light.</td>', 'Very appealing.  Nice natural light.', '2008-01-16 11:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396737, 632846, 84438, '<td valign="top">Not a totally original idea, but a nice execution!</td>', 'Not a totally original idea, but a nice execution!', '2008-01-16 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396740, 633913, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but there definately could be more contrast to this image.  The yellows could be a lot brighter to make them stand out more.</td>', 'Very nice, but there definately could be more contrast to this image.  The yellows could be a lot brighter to make them stand out more.', '2008-01-16 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396743, 632757, 84438, '<td valign="top">Simple.  Nice composition.  Interesting subject.  Great!</td>', 'Simple.  Nice composition.  Interesting subject.  Great!', '2008-01-16 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396746, 632856, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The crop is a little too close to my liking, and it seems to lack focus, especially in the lemon slice.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The crop is a little too close to my liking, and it seems to lack focus, especially in the lemon slice.', '2008-01-16 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396747, 633773, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very appealing photo, and the white really makes the flower stand out.  Nice a simple!</td>', 'Very appealing photo, and the white really makes the flower stand out.  Nice a simple!', '2008-01-16 12:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396754, 631014, 72070, '<td valign="top">nice abstract shot with good depth of field and great curves!</td>', 'nice abstract shot with good depth of field and great curves!', '2008-01-16 12:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396756, 632842, 72070, '<td valign="top">i like the composition and the DOF ...</td>', 'i like the composition and the DOF ...', '2008-01-16 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4396759, 633812, 84438, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would make this beautiful subject stand out more.  Make sure to check your histogram..  There''s nothing in the highlights section, which makes the image look a bit flat.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would make this beautiful subject stand out more.  Make sure to check your histogram..  There''s nothing in the highlights section, which makes the image look a bit flat.', '2008-01-16 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396760, 632678, 84438, '<td valign="top">Interesting, though a bit blown out!  The sky is quite noisy.</td>', 'Interesting, though a bit blown out!  The sky is quite noisy.', '2008-01-16 12:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396761, 633159, 72070, '<td valign="top">really nice colours (even though the blue could be even a tad darker).. I like how you shot it from below, with the water dripping down .. a really "fresh" shot!</td>', 'really nice colours (even though the blue could be even a tad darker).. I like how you shot it from below, with the water dripping down .. a really "fresh" shot!', '2008-01-16 12:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396764, 633410, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautful and unique subject matter.  I find this photo to be very appealing.</td>', 'Beautful and unique subject matter.  I find this photo to be very appealing.', '2008-01-16 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396769, 632426, 84438, '<td valign="top">Neat photo.  There''s some glowing artifacts around the ducks, especially the front one, and it looks like the light is a litte harsh (I think I can see you in the back duck)</td>', 'Neat photo.  There''s some glowing artifacts around the ducks, especially the front one, and it looks like the light is a litte harsh (I think I can see you in the back duck)', '2008-01-16 12:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396770, 631108, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love the processing!!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love the processing!!', '2008-01-16 12:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396773, 631108, 72070, '<td valign="top">really good idea... the shot seems so "square" ...I guess you cropped it a bit, but with this vertical subject I would have preferred a "higher" shot... and I''m asking myself if the shot wouldnt have been even better if you had  excluded most of the upper part (the one that''s not the street). This way there wouldnt be so many distracting details and the eye would have really been drawn right into the picture!<br/> <br/>But as it is it''s a great shot!</td>', 'really good idea... the shot seems so "square" ...I guess you cropped it a bit, but with this vertical subject I would have preferred a "higher" shot... and I''m asking myself if the shot wouldnt have been even better if you had  excluded most of the upper part (the one that''s not the street). This way there wouldnt be so many distracting details and the eye would have really been drawn right into the picture! But as it is it''s a great shot!', '2008-01-16 12:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396775, 632291, 84438, '<td valign="top">A very cool photo.  Is it just me, or is the window a little crooked?</td>', 'A very cool photo.  Is it just me, or is the window a little crooked?', '2008-01-16 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396777, 633866, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice definition, and the contrast looks perfect.</td>', 'Nice definition, and the contrast looks perfect.', '2008-01-16 12:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396779, 631870, 84438, '<td valign="top">Great!  Very interesting subject!</td>', 'Great!  Very interesting subject!', '2008-01-16 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396780, 632456, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!!  Simple.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Nicely done!!  Simple.  Beautiful.', '2008-01-16 12:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396783, 633739, 72070, '<td valign="top">a bit too bright... but the idea with the drop and the 2 "circles" is really good... maybe you could have made it really symmetrical by having the drop right in the middle, an both leom parts at an equal size! great substance in you shot!!</td>', 'a bit too bright... but the idea with the drop and the 2 "circles" is really good... maybe you could have made it really symmetrical by having the drop right in the middle, an both leom parts at an equal size! great substance in you shot!!', '2008-01-16 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396784, 632833, 84438, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast on the car would make it pop more, but I know that your background would be blown then.  Too bad this is basic editting! :)</td>', 'A bit more contrast on the car would make it pop more, but I know that your background would be blown then.  Too bad this is basic editting! :)', '2008-01-16 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396785, 632290, 72070, '<td valign="top">really nice how you caught the reflection in those drops! great shot!</td>', 'really nice how you caught the reflection in those drops! great shot!', '2008-01-16 12:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396789, 631014, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  Very interesting details.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  Very interesting details.', '2008-01-16 12:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396794, 633674, 84438, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a nice photo.  Here''s a few things that would make me score this much higher (If you''ll indulge me!)<br/>- Using a real flower instead of a silk one.  This just looks too fake to me.<br/>- Brighter light, making the photo more high key.<br/>- The face is a bit too shiny and unevenly lit.  Some makeup and more light would really make a difference.</td>', 'I find this to be a nice photo.  Here''s a few things that would make me score this much higher (If you''ll indulge me!)- Using a real flower instead of a silk one.  This just looks too fake to me.- Brighter light, making the photo more high key.- The face is a bit too shiny and unevenly lit.  Some makeup and more light would really make a difference.', '2008-01-16 12:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396795, 633242, 84438, '<td valign="top">Scary!  Nice!</td>', 'Scary!  Nice!', '2008-01-16 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396796, 633216, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  You turned a very ordinary subject into something very unique!</td>', 'Very nicely done.  You turned a very ordinary subject into something very unique!', '2008-01-16 12:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
