(4397248, 633739, 88590, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2008-01-16 14:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397249, 633450, 85886, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant on every level.  Finding it hard to give you constructive criticism when it''s all positive!  Firstly it''s original and that always gets extra points from me.  Secondly it meets the challenge so perfectly, the yellow against the grey tones everywhere else.  Thirdly the technical execution is brilliant with all the depth of field and focus.  The lighting from within being the only obvious in-frame lighting is outstanding.  I''m only 28% through the images but I really want this to ribbon.  Well done!</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant on every level.  Finding it hard to give you constructive criticism when it''s all positive!  Firstly it''s original and that always gets extra points from me.  Secondly it meets the challenge so perfectly, the yellow against the grey tones everywhere else.  Thirdly the technical execution is brilliant with all the depth of field and focus.  The lighting from within being the only obvious in-frame lighting is outstanding.  I''m only 28% through the images but I really want this to ribbon.  Well done!', '2008-01-16 14:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397252, 632803, 85886, '<td valign="top">I get that it''s the yellow of the cat''s eye, but of all the yellow items you have at home that you chose to submit this one.</td>', 'I get that it''s the yellow of the cat''s eye, but of all the yellow items you have at home that you chose to submit this one.', '2008-01-16 14:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397255, 631936, 88590, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2008-01-16 14:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397256, 633298, 88590, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2008-01-16 14:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397258, 633769, 88590, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Original idea, nicely composed and lit.</td>', 'very nice.  Original idea, nicely composed and lit.', '2008-01-16 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397259, 631749, 88590, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2008-01-16 14:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397263, 633419, 85886, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Refreshing idea and really nicely executed.</td>', 'Love it!  Refreshing idea and really nicely executed.', '2008-01-16 14:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397274, 633885, 85886, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation and execution.  A really strong image.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation and execution.  A really strong image.', '2008-01-16 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397295, 633829, 85886, '<td valign="top">I stayed in that very room and my view was very very different - I''m complaining immediately.  I think you could have pushed the colours a little more on this - I like the natural framing and the obviously attractive lines of the subject (tactfully put eh?!) but I think the yellow of her bikini could be used to make it/her stand out against greens of the trees behind (oops..this is basic editing...ah well).</td>', 'I stayed in that very room and my view was very very different - I''m complaining immediately.  I think you could have pushed the colours a little more on this - I like the natural framing and the obviously attractive lines of the subject (tactfully put eh?!) but I think the yellow of her bikini could be used to make it/her stand out against greens of the trees behind (oops..this is basic editing...ah well).', '2008-01-16 14:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397300, 633125, 85886, '<td valign="top">I really want to not like this but I really love it!  The lines and the refraction suck me in from both symmetries.  Nice take on what I think is sometimes a cliche shot.</td>', 'I really want to not like this but I really love it!  The lines and the refraction suck me in from both symmetries.  Nice take on what I think is sometimes a cliche shot.', '2008-01-16 14:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397305, 633867, 85886, '<td valign="top">Funny!  How you managed to turn a simple Yellow challenge into an implied penis enlarger is what''s fascinating here :)  Footpump and vase used to comical effect.</td>', 'Funny!  How you managed to turn a simple Yellow challenge into an implied penis enlarger is what''s fascinating here :)  Footpump and vase used to comical effect.', '2008-01-16 14:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397310, 633952, 85886, '<td valign="top">Yellows are pushed too far imho...I like the composition and I get the hard yellow but it''s just a tad too far, blowing out highlights.</td>', 'Yellows are pushed too far imho...I like the composition and I get the hard yellow but it''s just a tad too far, blowing out highlights.', '2008-01-16 14:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397336, 633812, 80859, '<td valign="top">beautiful flower and nicely composed.  i think, perhaps, the lighting could have been better.  the center is too shadowed and should pop for more impact.</td>', 'beautiful flower and nicely composed.  i think, perhaps, the lighting could have been better.  the center is too shadowed and should pop for more impact.', '2008-01-16 14:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397374, 633402, 39679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but with the black background your glass is almost completely lost.  If you would used a lighter (white or better blue) background I think your glass would really have stood out.</td>', 'I like this shot but with the black background your glass is almost completely lost.  If you would used a lighter (white or better blue) background I think your glass would really have stood out.', '2008-01-16 15:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397403, 632737, 85886, '<td valign="top">LOL - so that''s the little sod that has been giving me such a hard time with the voting...</td>', 'LOL - so that''s the little sod that has been giving me such a hard time with the voting...', '2008-01-16 15:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397408, 633402, 85886, '<td valign="top">Too much of the glass is lost to the background unfortunately... nice idea but I think seeing the glass and it''s lovely curves would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Too much of the glass is lost to the background unfortunately... nice idea but I think seeing the glass and it''s lovely curves would have helped a lot.', '2008-01-16 15:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397411, 632229, 88148, '<td valign="top">sweet, number one fo sho</td>', 'sweet, number one fo sho', '2008-01-16 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397418, 632564, 85886, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I really like ''real world'' shots like this...especially yours that shows gritty reality but turns it into a thing of beauty.  Great contrast between the canister and the blackened wall and lovely textures.  Might benefit from being just a touch sharper.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I really like ''real world'' shots like this...especially yours that shows gritty reality but turns it into a thing of beauty.  Great contrast between the canister and the blackened wall and lovely textures.  Might benefit from being just a touch sharper.', '2008-01-16 15:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397421, 632818, 88148, '<td valign="top">very intense, maybe a different shade on the background would define the mouth more.</td>', 'very intense, maybe a different shade on the background would define the mouth more.', '2008-01-16 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397422, 633956, 88148, '<td valign="top">nice and crisp</td>', 'nice and crisp', '2008-01-16 15:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397429, 633915, 85886, '<td valign="top">Really innovative and beautifully shot.  It almost looks computer generated (raytraced) because the lighting is so tightly controlled but I love the elegant shadowing, especially in the lesser lit ''blade'' which provides sufficient diversity in the piece without detracting.  Brilliant stuff.</td>', 'Really innovative and beautifully shot.  It almost looks computer generated (raytraced) because the lighting is so tightly controlled but I love the elegant shadowing, especially in the lesser lit ''blade'' which provides sufficient diversity in the piece without detracting.  Brilliant stuff.', '2008-01-16 15:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397430, 633242, 40464, '<td valign="top">It woud be much better if the whole snake''s head was in the shot...</td>', 'It woud be much better if the whole snake''s head was in the shot...', '2008-01-16 15:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397431, 632488, 88148, '<td valign="top">A bit too intense for my liking</td>', 'A bit too intense for my liking', '2008-01-16 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397436, 633023, 86799, '<td valign="top">Different.  Intriguing.  Weird...but cool.</td>', 'Different.  Intriguing.  Weird...but cool.', '2008-01-16 15:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397437, 632757, 85886, '<td valign="top">Super cool shot...in fact positively frosty.  Brilliant in simplicity and really appealing with the huge negative space to offset the shapely yellow.  A favourite.</td>', 'Super cool shot...in fact positively frosty.  Brilliant in simplicity and really appealing with the huge negative space to offset the shapely yellow.  A favourite.', '2008-01-16 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397440, 632737, 88148, '<td valign="top">not much here</td>', 'not much here', '2008-01-16 15:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397443, 631706, 86799, '<td valign="top">Needs a lot more sharpness, IMO.</td>', 'Needs a lot more sharpness, IMO.', '2008-01-16 15:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397444, 632040, 88148, '<td valign="top">you probably could have gotten a much more beautiful photo if you focused on the yellow rather than the DPC''r</td>', 'you probably could have gotten a much more beautiful photo if you focused on the yellow rather than the DPC''r', '2008-01-16 15:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397447, 633767, 40464, '<td valign="top">Pretty much a snapshot. Shooting it from some more inspirative angle might result with much more interesting pic.</td>', 'Pretty much a snapshot. Shooting it from some more inspirative angle might result with much more interesting pic.', '2008-01-16 15:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397450, 633336, 88148, '<td valign="top">Is this the only yellow in your life?</td>', 'Is this the only yellow in your life?', '2008-01-16 15:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397452, 632053, 85886, '<td valign="top">That''ll be the Mumford Time Machine eh?  Amazing shot and really visually appealing.  The bold knife is much better than a pin or bb gun as many others have done...much stronger imagery.  I''m off to rob a bank or sell my wife to get one of those boxes ;)</td>', 'That''ll be the Mumford Time Machine eh?  Amazing shot and really visually appealing.  The bold knife is much better than a pin or bb gun as many others have done...much stronger imagery.  I''m off to rob a bank or sell my wife to get one of those boxes ;)', '2008-01-16 15:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397454, 630853, 88148, '<td valign="top">quite boring</td>', 'quite boring', '2008-01-16 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397460, 633120, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.  Fantastic quirky idea and nicely executed.  Might have been nice to have a little more exposure/lighting towards the tip but I can see why so much solid black is needed to make the point with the yellow background.  I really enjoyed this one...it''s almost negative eye candy...</td>', 'Great stuff.  Fantastic quirky idea and nicely executed.  Might have been nice to have a little more exposure/lighting towards the tip but I can see why so much solid black is needed to make the point with the yellow background.  I really enjoyed this one...it''s almost negative eye candy...', '2008-01-16 15:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
