(4397548, 633903, 70689, '<td valign="top">I''d say brown. <br/> <br/>ETA: Oops, reread this and thought that was a pretty unclear comment. I am not hinting at the brown ribbon, it is technically well done. I just think the leaf is brownish rather than yellow</td>', 'I''d say brown.  ETA: Oops, reread this and thought that was a pretty unclear comment. I am not hinting at the brown ribbon, it is technically well done. I just think the leaf is brownish rather than yellow', '2008-01-16 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
