(4397673, 632123, 62318, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like an orange, except I realize the shape is a lemon? Love the shadows and the placement of items is nice too.</td>', 'It almost looks like an orange, except I realize the shape is a lemon? Love the shadows and the placement of items is nice too.', '2008-01-16 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
