(4397714, 632377, 70689, '<td valign="top">Okay. This made me think. Are you trying to say something? Are you trying to fool people? Have you lost a bet?<br/> <br/>I think your dof is too shallow, but I''ll give you a six, ''cos I love it when people make me think :)</td>', 'Okay. This made me think. Are you trying to say something? Are you trying to fool people? Have you lost a bet? I think your dof is too shallow, but I''ll give you a six, ''cos I love it when people make me think :)', '2008-01-16 17:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397717, 632280, 70689, '<td valign="top">No, sorry, old Dutch masters dont''t use harsh lighting. ;)</td>', 'No, sorry, old Dutch masters dont''t use harsh lighting. ;)', '2008-01-16 17:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397719, 631478, 70689, '<td valign="top">lemons are yellow, but you pictured the not-so-yellow part</td>', 'lemons are yellow, but you pictured the not-so-yellow part', '2008-01-16 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397748, 633450, 80058, '<td valign="top">Love love love &lt;3</td>', 'Love love love <3', '2008-01-16 17:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
