(4397757, 633504, 80058, '<td valign="top">This is great!! Nice lil partayyyyy I love teh lil lemon on the left corner, he had ONE too many drinks n passed out hahahahahaha n the other 2 at the back hahahahahahahah, perfectly meets the challenge with different types of yellows too =] I''m sure it''s gonna do well</td>', 'This is great!! Nice lil partayyyyy I love teh lil lemon on the left corner, he had ONE too many drinks n passed out hahahahahaha n the other 2 at the back hahahahahahahah, perfectly meets the challenge with different types of yellows too =] I''m sure it''s gonna do well', '2008-01-16 17:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397761, 633643, 80058, '<td valign="top">This type of imagery suits me =] 10! Lovely colours, great composition, nice natural lighting can''t go wrong in my eyes</td>', 'This type of imagery suits me =] 10! Lovely colours, great composition, nice natural lighting can''t go wrong in my eyes', '2008-01-16 17:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397764, 633573, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! :)  Couple of nitpicks.. for the challenge at hand it would''ve been best you probably used a yellow pastel fabric instead of pink, since it now competes with the yellows of the flowers. Might lose points for that but I really like the colors. And the tree branch near the top left.</td>', 'Nice shot! :)  Couple of nitpicks.. for the challenge at hand it would''ve been best you probably used a yellow pastel fabric instead of pink, since it now competes with the yellows of the flowers. Might lose points for that but I really like the colors. And the tree branch near the top left.', '2008-01-16 17:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
