(4398527, 633674, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The center of the flower is a bit too dominant. Petals are clearly artificial which detracts. Lighting on face seems a bit harsh (and on flower). I like that it''s off center and tightly cropped.</td>', 'Nice idea. The center of the flower is a bit too dominant. Petals are clearly artificial which detracts. Lighting on face seems a bit harsh (and on flower). I like that it''s off center and tightly cropped.', '2008-01-16 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
