(4398534, 632629, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the enhanced contrast and shadows on the petals. I''m not sure how you isolated the yellow of the flower within basic editing rules, but if you did, very well done. I''ll assume not and vote high!</td>', 'Great shot. I love the enhanced contrast and shadows on the petals. I''m not sure how you isolated the yellow of the flower within basic editing rules, but if you did, very well done. I''ll assume not and vote high!', '2008-01-16 22:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
