(4398552, 632274, 31214, '<td valign="top">Poor composition - extra people in picture are distracting.  Horizon is tilted left.  A date or something in the photo?  Blown sky.  Nice orb.</td>', 'Poor composition - extra people in picture are distracting.  Horizon is tilted left.  A date or something in the photo?  Blown sky.  Nice orb.', '2008-01-16 22:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
