(4398560, 631014, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice yellow color, repeating patterns. A little too abstract for me. My eye is attracted to the dark spots yet I don''t think they''re especially interesting. I think you''d either want to make the dark spots an interesting subject or find a way to not have them in the shot.</td>', 'Nice yellow color, repeating patterns. A little too abstract for me. My eye is attracted to the dark spots yet I don''t think they''re especially interesting. I think you''d either want to make the dark spots an interesting subject or find a way to not have them in the shot.', '2008-01-16 22:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4398567, 633124, 88756, '<td valign="top">Elegant velvet!</td>', 'Elegant velvet!', '2008-01-16 22:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4398568, 632017, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Beautiful flowers. Nice sharp focus, black background works well. I think you''d be better with an odd number of flowers. Two is confusing... I''m not sure which one to look at. 1 or 3 would be better for me. Overall nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Beautiful flowers. Nice sharp focus, black background works well. I think you''d be better with an odd number of flowers. Two is confusing... I''m not sure which one to look at. 1 or 3 would be better for me. Overall nicely done.', '2008-01-16 22:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4398572, 632511, 88204, '<td valign="top">Even with the title I can''t visualize what this is so I see it just as abstract shapes. That said, it holds up well with no title. The irregular shapes, shiny surfaces and depth catch my eye.</td>', 'Even with the title I can''t visualize what this is so I see it just as abstract shapes. That said, it holds up well with no title. The irregular shapes, shiny surfaces and depth catch my eye.', '2008-01-16 22:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
