(4399142, 633774, 49109, '<td valign="top">crop is too tight at each side. needs a bump in saturation and contrast. The image would have been much more interesting, if you had used a wider aperture -&gt; shallow DOF, which had blurred the now distracting background scene.</td>', 'crop is too tight at each side. needs a bump in saturation and contrast. The image would have been much more interesting, if you had used a wider aperture -> shallow DOF, which had blurred the now distracting background scene.', '2008-01-17 04:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
