(4399164, 633512, 49109, '<td valign="top">has a snapshotty feel to it. this could have been a much better image, if you had taken just a minute to compose ypur picture. you could have stepped 2 or 3 feet back to get the whole thing into the frame. a lower point of view (instead of the usual view from eye level) together with a shallow DOF (=wide aperture) to blur the background had emphasized the "human" shape of the hydrant.</td>', 'has a snapshotty feel to it. this could have been a much better image, if you had taken just a minute to compose ypur picture. you could have stepped 2 or 3 feet back to get the whole thing into the frame. a lower point of view (instead of the usual view from eye level) together with a shallow DOF (=wide aperture) to blur the background had emphasized the "human" shape of the hydrant.', '2008-01-17 04:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399168, 633023, 49109, '<td valign="top">looks funny, but I really don''t get the story behind it. a bit much space to the left.</td>', 'looks funny, but I really don''t get the story behind it. a bit much space to the left.', '2008-01-17 04:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
