(4399952, 633171, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like that you were able to fill the entire frame with yellow. The yellow color is a bit softer than the yellows in other pictures. I think that''s because you didn''t crank up the saturation like many others did. I like it as is with that gentle color, gentle lighting. Nice sharp focus on the center lego. Might have been nice to move that center lego off center just so it''s not smack down the middle.</td>', 'I like that you were able to fill the entire frame with yellow. The yellow color is a bit softer than the yellows in other pictures. I think that''s because you didn''t crank up the saturation like many others did. I like it as is with that gentle color, gentle lighting. Nice sharp focus on the center lego. Might have been nice to move that center lego off center just so it''s not smack down the middle.', '2008-01-17 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
