(4404513, 632476, 81382, '<td valign="top">A fairly reddish skin tone which could have been calmed down a bit during post processing. I''m guesing the flower head represents the yellow element - however its not the main subject and its not very yellow, at least not on my display</td>', 'A fairly reddish skin tone which could have been calmed down a bit during post processing. I''m guesing the flower head represents the yellow element - however its not the main subject and its not very yellow, at least not on my display', '2008-01-19 11:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404518, 631942, 81382, '<td valign="top">Why not tweek the hue from green to yellow during postprocessing. Either that or I need to get down to Argos and buy another monitor as this is coming across very much on the green side. Not particularly sharp, a shame really as the composition is great and could have been really dramatic</td>', 'Why not tweek the hue from green to yellow during postprocessing. Either that or I need to get down to Argos and buy another monitor as this is coming across very much on the green side. Not particularly sharp, a shame really as the composition is great and could have been really dramatic', '2008-01-19 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404522, 633159, 81382, '<td valign="top">Works well against the blue but seems a little noisy. Painting with light over a long exposure would have given this an extra dimension and increased the difficulty/technical factor required to score near the top</td>', 'Works well against the blue but seems a little noisy. Painting with light over a long exposure would have given this an extra dimension and increased the difficulty/technical factor required to score near the top', '2008-01-19 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
