(4409448, 633592, 81382, '<td valign="top">Uninspiring title and the image itself could easily have been about the orange feet instead - it is relatively loosely connected with the yellow brief compared to some of the other entries.</td>', 'Uninspiring title and the image itself could easily have been about the orange feet instead - it is relatively loosely connected with the yellow brief compared to some of the other entries.', '2008-01-21 08:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4409458, 632678, 81382, '<td valign="top">Could either do with a ccw rotation to make the posts vertical or even more of a cw rotation to make the angle more purposeful and aggressive. This is halfway between the two and I''m left wondering what you intended. Blown out areas of the rocks are not ideal. You clearly had lots of light and so I am confused as to why the sky appears quite noisy as you must have been set on slow ISO.</td>', 'Could either do with a ccw rotation to make the posts vertical or even more of a cw rotation to make the angle more purposeful and aggressive. This is halfway between the two and I''m left wondering what you intended. Blown out areas of the rocks are not ideal. You clearly had lots of light and so I am confused as to why the sky appears quite noisy as you must have been set on slow ISO.', '2008-01-21 08:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4409465, 632280, 81382, '<td valign="top">Burnt out areas of the lemon, could have done with softer lighting to overcome that. Painting with light techniques would have given an added dimension to this and increased the difficulty factor to this otherwise relatively straight-forward still life.</td>', 'Burnt out areas of the lemon, could have done with softer lighting to overcome that. Painting with light techniques would have given an added dimension to this and increased the difficulty factor to this otherwise relatively straight-forward still life.', '2008-01-21 08:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4409468, 631432, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the border but its certainly different and given me something to think about so thats all good stuff. Good sharpness on the leaf against a non-distracting, but still quite interesting background.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the border but its certainly different and given me something to think about so thats all good stuff. Good sharpness on the leaf against a non-distracting, but still quite interesting background.', '2008-01-21 08:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
