(4411100, 633643, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast and composition.  I really like how the dark window stands out.  Well seen and captured.  Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely contrast and composition.  I really like how the dark window stands out.  Well seen and captured.  Good luck!', '2008-01-21 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411105, 633937, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job of covering a full range of canvas with this composition.  It tells a story, yet isn''t too cluttered.  I think the background (while nice in appearance) is taking away some of the "Yellow" impact.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice job of covering a full range of canvas with this composition.  It tells a story, yet isn''t too cluttered.  I think the background (while nice in appearance) is taking away some of the "Yellow" impact.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-21 16:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411107, 633627, 30049, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many will miss the color temp connection?  This is an interesting choice of an entry for the challenge.  Brave too!  Have a feeling you''re getting hammered on score a little?  Good luck.</td>', 'I wonder how many will miss the color temp connection?  This is an interesting choice of an entry for the challenge.  Brave too!  Have a feeling you''re getting hammered on score a little?  Good luck.', '2008-01-21 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411108, 632112, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool POV and nice use of a polarizer to darken the blue skies.  The white vehicle in the bottom-right background is pulling at my attention a little.</td>', 'Cool POV and nice use of a polarizer to darken the blue skies.  The white vehicle in the bottom-right background is pulling at my attention a little.', '2008-01-21 16:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411109, 633523, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting work in patterns.  I wonder if you had gone with a portrait orientation on your composition if you could have eliminated the wall on the right.  This just feels like a vertical presentation would be stronger.  Have NO idea what the title means.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting work in patterns.  I wonder if you had gone with a portrait orientation on your composition if you could have eliminated the wall on the right.  This just feels like a vertical presentation would be stronger.  Have NO idea what the title means.  Good luck.', '2008-01-21 16:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411112, 631094, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  It''s yellow.  Why a hangman''s noose?  That is going to turn some people off I think.  With a cleaner background this probably would score a tad higher as well.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep.  It''s yellow.  Why a hangman''s noose?  That is going to turn some people off I think.  With a cleaner background this probably would score a tad higher as well.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-21 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411240, 632678, 73998, '<td valign="top">It looks too over processed and there''s a lot of noise in the sky.  Otherwise, I like it.</td>', 'It looks too over processed and there''s a lot of noise in the sky.  Otherwise, I like it.', '2008-01-21 17:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411244, 632476, 73998, '<td valign="top">Is there even anything yellow in the photograph...?</td>', 'Is there even anything yellow in the photograph...?', '2008-01-21 17:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411251, 631214, 73998, '<td valign="top">Nice effort, however, I would''ve preferred it if the caterpillar''s head was in focus too.</td>', 'Nice effort, however, I would''ve preferred it if the caterpillar''s head was in focus too.', '2008-01-21 17:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411296, 632290, 73998, '<td valign="top">Nice try!  Good composition but the droplets look slightly out of focus.  Maybe if this was sharpened a little it would help.</td>', 'Nice try!  Good composition but the droplets look slightly out of focus.  Maybe if this was sharpened a little it would help.', '2008-01-21 17:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
