(4412612, 633120, 87351, '<td valign="top">You just knew this challenge would be full of bananas and lemons - I like that you did something different with it.</td>', 'You just knew this challenge would be full of bananas and lemons - I like that you did something different with it.', '2008-01-22 00:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412613, 633842, 30048, '<td valign="top">it is not very yellow!</td>', 'it is not very yellow!', '2008-01-22 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412989, 632737, 58272, '<td valign="top">I used to have one of those. Ahh....nostalgia. The composition here feels a little awkward. I''m one to break rules but it feels like this should either be completely centered or complying to the "rule of thirds"</td>', 'I used to have one of those. Ahh....nostalgia. The composition here feels a little awkward. I''m one to break rules but it feels like this should either be completely centered or complying to the "rule of thirds"', '2008-01-22 06:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412991, 633670, 58272, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed with the effort that seems to have gone into this.</td>', 'I''m impressed with the effort that seems to have gone into this.', '2008-01-22 06:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412999, 632941, 58272, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool spoon! It may just be my monitor but the background seems to be a bit uneven (tones and shadows).</td>', 'That''s a cool spoon! It may just be my monitor but the background seems to be a bit uneven (tones and shadows).', '2008-01-22 06:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413006, 632899, 58272, '<td valign="top">Noise reduction in pp might help here, also a shaprer focus, paritculary on the eye.</td>', 'Noise reduction in pp might help here, also a shaprer focus, paritculary on the eye.', '2008-01-22 06:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413010, 632806, 58272, '<td valign="top">A cool character. The spots on the background (bokeh? sensor dust?) are a bit distracting.</td>', 'A cool character. The spots on the background (bokeh? sensor dust?) are a bit distracting.', '2008-01-22 06:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413014, 633937, 58272, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between life and death, happiness / sadness etc. I also like the textures here. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice contrast between life and death, happiness / sadness etc. I also like the textures here. Nice work.', '2008-01-22 06:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413147, 633734, 81382, '<td valign="top">Yellow hue could have done with a bit of a saturation boost to make it more vibrant. Whats with the purple shadows and and the purple halos around the outsides of the tomatoes. Well composed although spoilt a bit for me by the overstylised border</td>', 'Yellow hue could have done with a bit of a saturation boost to make it more vibrant. Whats with the purple shadows and and the purple halos around the outsides of the tomatoes. Well composed although spoilt a bit for me by the overstylised border', '2008-01-22 08:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413149, 631038, 81382, '<td valign="top">FAT border - whats going on there, hardly any room left for the imagel which, by the way, is pretty good, lovely lighting, DOF and vibrant colours</td>', 'FAT border - whats going on there, hardly any room left for the imagel which, by the way, is pretty good, lovely lighting, DOF and vibrant colours', '2008-01-22 08:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413152, 632701, 81382, '<td valign="top">This just seems very flat somehow - the pure black and white corners do nothing to add interest. Perhaps a lower viewpoint, macro, much wider angle and larger apature to get some perspective distortion and DOF to vary the texture and add interest.</td>', 'This just seems very flat somehow - the pure black and white corners do nothing to add interest. Perhaps a lower viewpoint, macro, much wider angle and larger apature to get some perspective distortion and DOF to vary the texture and add interest.', '2008-01-22 08:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413154, 632708, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not particularly original, burnt out specular highlights in places and it seems to fade to black pretty aggressively where it would meet a surface and seems a little odd. The word "Yellow" spelt out with lots of oranges would have put all the other lemon entries to shame.</td>', 'Not particularly original, burnt out specular highlights in places and it seems to fade to black pretty aggressively where it would meet a surface and seems a little odd. The word "Yellow" spelt out with lots of oranges would have put all the other lemon entries to shame.', '2008-01-22 08:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413157, 632564, 81382, '<td valign="top">Image seems pretty flat, a lower viewpoint with wide angle lens would have given this more interest and impact. Interesting subject though - having just voted on three lemons in a row</td>', 'Image seems pretty flat, a lower viewpoint with wide angle lens would have given this more interest and impact. Interesting subject though - having just voted on three lemons in a row', '2008-01-22 08:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413160, 633394, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and DOF with the added interest / difficulty of having a butterfly. It could be a fake one though and so that would neutralise the difficulty but these things should be taken by face value so well done. Nice uncomplicated background and rich yellow hues</td>', 'Lovely lighting and DOF with the added interest / difficulty of having a butterfly. It could be a fake one though and so that would neutralise the difficulty but these things should be taken by face value so well done. Nice uncomplicated background and rich yellow hues', '2008-01-22 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413163, 631730, 81382, '<td valign="top">Ruined by the reflection for me - added to the fairly dull yellow hue. A circular polarising filter should have sorted you out</td>', 'Ruined by the reflection for me - added to the fairly dull yellow hue. A circular polarising filter should have sorted you out', '2008-01-22 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413165, 631094, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition of the shape with the shadow - good composition, well thought out. Good lighting to, no blown out highlights which seem to get critised here a lot.</td>', 'Nice repetition of the shape with the shadow - good composition, well thought out. Good lighting to, no blown out highlights which seem to get critised here a lot.', '2008-01-22 08:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413167, 633952, 81382, '<td valign="top">Very heavily saturated yellow comes across on my display as being quite unnatural. The shop sign could almost have been created in MS Paint with a yellow floodfilled rectangle with the yellow and red colours coming straight from the default colour picker.</td>', 'Very heavily saturated yellow comes across on my display as being quite unnatural. The shop sign could almost have been created in MS Paint with a yellow floodfilled rectangle with the yellow and red colours coming straight from the default colour picker.', '2008-01-22 08:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413169, 632063, 81382, '<td valign="top">A black background would have been much more dramatic than a yellow one - requiring a reconsidered title of course. Seems to be lacking sharpness in the center of the flower head. A couple of water drops would have sorted this out and added some much needed sparkle to brighten things up a bit. Well composed though</td>', 'A black background would have been much more dramatic than a yellow one - requiring a reconsidered title of course. Seems to be lacking sharpness in the center of the flower head. A couple of water drops would have sorted this out and added some much needed sparkle to brighten things up a bit. Well composed though', '2008-01-22 08:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413170, 632906, 81382, '<td valign="top">Seems like a winner to me. I''ll give up commenting if this doesn''t make the top ten. Great expressions, lovely lighting, well composed, warm yellow hues - this has to win</td>', 'Seems like a winner to me. I''ll give up commenting if this doesn''t make the top ten. Great expressions, lovely lighting, well composed, warm yellow hues - this has to win', '2008-01-22 08:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413173, 633956, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great s-curve text book composition, although you could have pushed it harder with a more dramatic rotation during the cropping stage. Yellow is not the dominant colour but because of the composition it become the key subject - very clever</td>', 'Great s-curve text book composition, although you could have pushed it harder with a more dramatic rotation during the cropping stage. Yellow is not the dominant colour but because of the composition it become the key subject - very clever', '2008-01-22 08:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413174, 632112, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely aggressive viewpoint. Wide angle lenses were made for cars.</td>', 'Lovely aggressive viewpoint. Wide angle lenses were made for cars.', '2008-01-22 08:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413177, 632426, 81382, '<td valign="top">Fairly mundane subject matter, the rubber ducks and lemons belong to each other. Being more creative and pushing the boundaries of the brief will lead to higher scores</td>', 'Fairly mundane subject matter, the rubber ducks and lemons belong to each other. Being more creative and pushing the boundaries of the brief will lead to higher scores', '2008-01-22 08:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413178, 633603, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great focusing, lovely backlighting too. Perhaps would have desaturated the green/blue hues as they do nothing to reinforce the concept or subject of this image and only complicate things for me</td>', 'Great focusing, lovely backlighting too. Perhaps would have desaturated the green/blue hues as they do nothing to reinforce the concept or subject of this image and only complicate things for me', '2008-01-22 08:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413180, 633769, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract image, great lighting, lovely contrast with the black shapes and good choice of crop angle.</td>', 'Lovely abstract image, great lighting, lovely contrast with the black shapes and good choice of crop angle.', '2008-01-22 08:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413201, 633947, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well handled exposure and a lovely sunset.  Probably getting some feedback on whether it''s true yellow or not...  For me, the color is "ok" for yellow, but does lean more towards orange IMO.  This looks like a nice location for getting some nice photos.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well handled exposure and a lovely sunset.  Probably getting some feedback on whether it''s true yellow or not...  For me, the color is "ok" for yellow, but does lean more towards orange IMO.  This looks like a nice location for getting some nice photos.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413207, 632017, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject.  Something about the lighting is taking away, rather than adding to, this image.  Light seems a little harsh and the details are getting lost somewhat.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely subject.  Something about the lighting is taking away, rather than adding to, this image.  Light seems a little harsh and the details are getting lost somewhat.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413218, 632514, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very lovely setting for a photo.  The composition works well with good exposure overall.  May have lost some drama in the upper-right sky, but it does look natural.  The yellow connection is probably a little thin for many voters.  Works ok for me overall.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very lovely setting for a photo.  The composition works well with good exposure overall.  May have lost some drama in the upper-right sky, but it does look natural.  The yellow connection is probably a little thin for many voters.  Works ok for me overall.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413225, 632918, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots you just can''t help but wonder what the rest of the story is.  The caution tape in front of the lifeguard is a interest grabber for sure.  :-)  Nice overall scene and captured well in a technical sense.  Ideally the lifeguard would be a tad more off-center to the left since he is looking right.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of those shots you just can''t help but wonder what the rest of the story is.  The caution tape in front of the lifeguard is a interest grabber for sure.  :-)  Nice overall scene and captured well in a technical sense.  Ideally the lifeguard would be a tad more off-center to the left since he is looking right.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413228, 633830, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute overall.  You can tell she''s smiling, which is kind of fun.  The yellow umbrella works, but the background is taking away from overall impact.</td>', 'Cute overall.  You can tell she''s smiling, which is kind of fun.  The yellow umbrella works, but the background is taking away from overall impact.', '2008-01-22 09:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413233, 633646, 30049, '<td valign="top">I kind of prefer a yellow subject to a yellow cast from lighting, but that''s JMO.  Nothing personal, but there''s nothing really jumping out here that holds my attention.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I kind of prefer a yellow subject to a yellow cast from lighting, but that''s JMO.  Nothing personal, but there''s nothing really jumping out here that holds my attention.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413248, 632456, 70875, '<td valign="top">It pop allright! Simple &amp; beatifull.</td>', 'It pop allright! Simple & beatifull.', '2008-01-22 09:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
