(4413252, 633100, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Nice use of lighting.  Destined to get hammered...toys.  Good luck!</td>', 'Cute.  Nice use of lighting.  Destined to get hammered...toys.  Good luck!', '2008-01-22 09:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413256, 633125, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why do these darn cliche shots always look so good?!  :-)  You pulled it off quite nicely (except for the minor dust/dirt in the reflections on table).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why do these darn cliche shots always look so good?!  :-)  You pulled it off quite nicely (except for the minor dust/dirt in the reflections on table).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413261, 633203, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Here''s one I like.  Nice use of DOF to use the yellow effectively and to bring the eye to the focal point(s) of the flower.  Well done!</td>', 'Ok.  Here''s one I like.  Nice use of DOF to use the yellow effectively and to bring the eye to the focal point(s) of the flower.  Well done!', '2008-01-22 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413264, 633505, 70875, '<td valign="top">Chilling, mysterious &amp; surreal.</td>', 'Chilling, mysterious & surreal.', '2008-01-22 09:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413266, 633915, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  This works.  I like it.  Would make a nice graphic for use in several stock scenarios and it''s a clever concept that is photographed well (exposure, lighting, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep.  This works.  I like it.  Would make a nice graphic for use in several stock scenarios and it''s a clever concept that is photographed well (exposure, lighting, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413268, 631747, 70875, '<td valign="top">lol, awesome capture!</td>', 'lol, awesome capture!', '2008-01-22 09:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413269, 632757, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.  Interesting subject.  Should do fine for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.  Interesting subject.  Should do fine for you.  Good luck.', '2008-01-22 09:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413272, 633741, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, the photo certainly has plenty of yellow in it.  :-)  The subject is a bit plain.  Some choices made in the composition are taking away from this.  The drive at the bottom, 2/3''s of the door on the left, a fraction of red on the right...without seeing the location it''s hard to say what could have been done differently - perhaps nothing.  Just making an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, the photo certainly has plenty of yellow in it.  :-)  The subject is a bit plain.  Some choices made in the composition are taking away from this.  The drive at the bottom, 2/3''s of the door on the left, a fraction of red on the right...without seeing the location it''s hard to say what could have been done differently - perhaps nothing.  Just making an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413273, 633049, 70875, '<td valign="top">Simple but compelling... the framing, texture of the wall and the shadows.</td>', 'Simple but compelling... the framing, texture of the wall and the shadows.', '2008-01-22 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413274, 631747, 30049, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot.  Hate to say it, but is that yellow or orange?  Regardless of color, the photo is a keeper.  For this challenge???  Not sure.  Good luck!</td>', 'Adorable shot.  Hate to say it, but is that yellow or orange?  Regardless of color, the photo is a keeper.  For this challenge???  Not sure.  Good luck!', '2008-01-22 09:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413279, 631870, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok".  The subject may be a bit bland. Nothing personal, just an observation.  It''s hard to crop a shot like this without seeing the perspective distortions (curved lines).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s "ok".  The subject may be a bit bland. Nothing personal, just an observation.  It''s hard to crop a shot like this without seeing the perspective distortions (curved lines).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413283, 633193, 30049, '<td valign="top">An interesting geometric, pattern kind of shot.  The honey color is too orange I think and you''re probably getting dinged on it some with scoring.  Good luck.</td>', 'An interesting geometric, pattern kind of shot.  The honey color is too orange I think and you''re probably getting dinged on it some with scoring.  Good luck.', '2008-01-22 09:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413287, 633738, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, this is interesting.  I like the nest.  I''m not getting the different egg pieces however, especially the dirt?  The white (cloth?) in the lower left is a distraction.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, this is interesting.  I like the nest.  I''m not getting the different egg pieces however, especially the dirt?  The white (cloth?) in the lower left is a distraction.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413289, 633410, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting looking place.  Hard decision on where to crop or frame this shot I''d imagine.  I think I''d have taken just a bit more off the left to lose that partial window.  In any case, good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting looking place.  Hard decision on where to crop or frame this shot I''d imagine.  I think I''d have taken just a bit more off the left to lose that partial window.  In any case, good luck to you in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413292, 633242, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool subject.  I wish the whole thing was in focus, especially the head.  A polarizer could have helped minimize the light reflections and add more punch to the color.</td>', 'Cool subject.  I wish the whole thing was in focus, especially the head.  A polarizer could have helped minimize the light reflections and add more punch to the color.', '2008-01-22 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413306, 632708, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s yellow.  :-)  Ummm...what else.  Let''s see.  The lighting is a little harsh - indirect (or bounced light) may have softened it a bit.  The composition is quite static with the centered subject.  Attention to detail (the lint specks on the dark background jump out immediately) is helpful as well in improving scores.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep, it''s yellow.  :-)  Ummm...what else.  Let''s see.  The lighting is a little harsh - indirect (or bounced light) may have softened it a bit.  The composition is quite static with the centered subject.  Attention to detail (the lint specks on the dark background jump out immediately) is helpful as well in improving scores.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413309, 631078, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely still life.  Lighting may be a tad hot in a couple of spots, but nothing extremely over the top.  Biggest thing holding this back I think will be the color tone; it seems more gold/orange than yellow.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely still life.  Lighting may be a tad hot in a couple of spots, but nothing extremely over the top.  Biggest thing holding this back I think will be the color tone; it seems more gold/orange than yellow.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413315, 632842, 30049, '<td valign="top">I get the idea of where you wanted to go with this; negative space, bokeh background, isolated subject.  It''s nearly there.  A little more space between the bottom of the flower and the bg bokeh would help some, and the flower would have had more impact if not in a state of decline.  All JMO.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get the idea of where you wanted to go with this; negative space, bokeh background, isolated subject.  It''s nearly there.  A little more space between the bottom of the flower and the bg bokeh would help some, and the flower would have had more impact if not in a state of decline.  All JMO.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 09:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413318, 633860, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is clever/creative and I like it overall.  Personally, I''d have cropped some off the left to lose the wood frame and nail.  Lighting is a tad hot on the very back edge of the "flower" thingee and in the resulting reflection on the glass.  A well conceived idea.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is clever/creative and I like it overall.  Personally, I''d have cropped some off the left to lose the wood frame and nail.  Lighting is a tad hot on the very back edge of the "flower" thingee and in the resulting reflection on the glass.  A well conceived idea.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 10:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413319, 632280, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice study in still life overall.  The lighting could be softened and warmed a little (a polarizer can help control the reflections some).</td>', 'A nice study in still life overall.  The lighting could be softened and warmed a little (a polarizer can help control the reflections some).', '2008-01-22 10:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413321, 633618, 30049, '<td valign="top">Curious.  Hard to tell what it is...very abstract.  I like the blue background as it works quite well with the gold colored subject.</td>', 'Curious.  Hard to tell what it is...very abstract.  I like the blue background as it works quite well with the gold colored subject.', '2008-01-22 10:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413323, 633504, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a greeting card.  :-)  Fun!</td>', 'Looks like a greeting card.  :-)  Fun!', '2008-01-22 10:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413325, 633859, 30049, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  What''d you do to the cat?  Certainly yellow!  :-)  Nice detail in the profile.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Whoa!  What''d you do to the cat?  Certainly yellow!  :-)  Nice detail in the profile.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 10:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413331, 633831, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice positioning of the subject in the comp.  May have wanted to pick a different time of day to take this as the lighting is quite direct and harsh.  Good detail and focus.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice positioning of the subject in the comp.  May have wanted to pick a different time of day to take this as the lighting is quite direct and harsh.  Good detail and focus.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 10:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413338, 631706, 30049, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper and the lighting toned down a bit.  Does look like a decent snack however.  :-)</td>', 'Could be sharper and the lighting toned down a bit.  Does look like a decent snack however.  :-)', '2008-01-22 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413342, 633263, 30049, '<td valign="top">You made a good choice in angling the flower petals across the image diagonally.  How''s this look when you take a peek at the histogram?  Seems a tad underexposed and flat.  Those water droplets should be jumping out for attention with some sparkle.  They may be too far away for proper impact as only the very center of the image is in focus.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You made a good choice in angling the flower petals across the image diagonally.  How''s this look when you take a peek at the histogram?  Seems a tad underexposed and flat.  Those water droplets should be jumping out for attention with some sparkle.  They may be too far away for proper impact as only the very center of the image is in focus.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413344, 632123, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting and good positioning of the subject material.  The forefront item appears to be orange?  Why not have yellow there?  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting and good positioning of the subject material.  The forefront item appears to be orange?  Why not have yellow there?  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-22 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413352, 631651, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job exposing this and controlling the light.  I like the reflections.  You''re losing some impact with the smaller size (you have 640 to use on the long side...you used 540).</td>', 'Nice job exposing this and controlling the light.  I like the reflections.  You''re losing some impact with the smaller size (you have 640 to use on the long side...you used 540).', '2008-01-22 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413362, 632290, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes...refractions.  :-)  You did a nice job of getting a clear shot of them.  Might have more impact if the drops were just a little closer and lose some of the excess background.  Just an observation.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ah, yes...refractions.  :-)  You did a nice job of getting a clear shot of them.  Might have more impact if the drops were just a little closer and lose some of the excess background.  Just an observation.  Good luck.', '2008-01-22 10:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
