(4415778, 632229, 69325, '<td valign="top">i''m not even going to try and put into words how happy/proud i am for you, you already know!  HUGE congrats and hugs and high fives and "WOO HOOS!" from across the pond!<br/> <br/>man i had to come back and edit this cuz i am just SO HAPPY for you, you always take the comments and votes to heart and i just love to see this validation of what i already considered your excellent work!<br/> <br/>first and second place are both Aussies?! i smell a conspiracy! <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-23 00:18:41.</i></td>', 'i''m not even going to try and put into words how happy/proud i am for you, you already know!  HUGE congrats and hugs and high fives and "WOO HOOS!" from across the pond! man i had to come back and edit this cuz i am just SO HAPPY for you, you always take the comments and votes to heart and i just love to see this validation of what i already considered your excellent work! first and second place are both Aussies?! i smell a conspiracy! ', '2008-01-23 00:05:03.000000', '2008-01-23 00:18:41.000000', 0);
