(4415787, 633380, 67697, '<td valign="top">yay I''m glad to see that the beagle placed in the top 20!  I can''t believe you got it to sit still like that.  He/she is adorable!</td>', 'yay I''m glad to see that the beagle placed in the top 20!  I can''t believe you got it to sit still like that.  He/she is adorable!', '2008-01-23 00:06:28.000000', NULL, 0),
