(4415794, 633450, 40718, '<td valign="top">like the shot a lot.  Love the creativity with the self-portrait.  I have a blast trying to do a shot like this because I don''t think anybody else wants to go out to an abandoned phone booth in the middle of the night.</td>', 'like the shot a lot.  Love the creativity with the self-portrait.  I have a blast trying to do a shot like this because I don''t think anybody else wants to go out to an abandoned phone booth in the middle of the night.', '2008-01-23 00:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
