(4415796, 633546, 29011, '<td valign="top">Been missing you from the challenges. Welcome back! :D<br/>Had a hint this was yours or someone trying out something similar to your work/style. I expected this would place higher but ever so glad you posted.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-23 00:21:12.</i></td>', 'Been missing you from the challenges. Welcome back! :DHad a hint this was yours or someone trying out something similar to your work/style. I expected this would place higher but ever so glad you posted.', '2008-01-23 00:08:07.000000', '2008-01-23 00:21:12.000000', 0),
(4415799, 631014, 88580, '<td valign="top"><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-03 18:35:23.</i></td>', '', '2008-01-23 00:08:31.000000', '2008-03-03 18:35:23.000000', 0),
(4415807, 631257, 29011, '<td valign="top">woohoo! Way to crack a 6 on your first challenge entry. Congratulations.</td>', 'woohoo! Way to crack a 6 on your first challenge entry. Congratulations.', '2008-01-23 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415811, 633869, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol what are you doing in last place again?  You should never have told that this was an olive bottle.  I thought it was just an abstracty ocean scene.  I like the blend in colors.  Congrats on your abstractness perfection.</td>', 'lol what are you doing in last place again?  You should never have told that this was an olive bottle.  I thought it was just an abstracty ocean scene.  I like the blend in colors.  Congrats on your abstractness perfection.', '2008-01-23 00:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415820, 633948, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hmmm these flowers look like mine!  I got mine at walmart.  The drops of water are a nice touch - it makes the flowers look so fresh.  Nice score from the commenters!</td>', 'Hmmm these flowers look like mine!  I got mine at walmart.  The drops of water are a nice touch - it makes the flowers look so fresh.  Nice score from the commenters!', '2008-01-23 00:13:14.000000', NULL, 0),
