(4415833, 632229, 48228, '<td valign="top">You are amazing and have a true gift for beauty with the nature around you..... <br/> <br/>Awesome image here Roz, and zI am so pleased it ribboned for you, a <b>BLUE </b> and so special to get for for this fine image.<br/> <br/><b>CONGRATULATIONS my dear friend.....</b></td>', 'You are amazing and have a true gift for beauty with the nature around you.....  Awesome image here Roz, and zI am so pleased it ribboned for you, a BLUE  and so special to get for for this fine image. CONGRATULATIONS my dear friend.....', '2008-01-23 00:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415834, 632229, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Roz.  Won''t Katee be jealous of the dragonfly!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations, Roz.  Won''t Katee be jealous of the dragonfly! ', '2008-01-23 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415844, 633120, 85886, '<td valign="top">Shame this didn''t place higher...much appreciation from over here though :)</td>', 'Shame this didn''t place higher...much appreciation from over here though :)', '2008-01-23 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415845, 633203, 69388, '<td valign="top">What?! 24th?!... I''m so surprised it''s not at least in the top ten. Beautiful clarity, colors, composition!</td>', 'What?! 24th?!... I''m so surprised it''s not at least in the top ten. Beautiful clarity, colors, composition!', '2008-01-23 00:18:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415847, 633523, 48471, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, votes and looking at this photo.<br/>I tried getting rid of the wall on the right, but then these two yellow things became too big, overwhelming the image. I didn''t want that. Vertical composition didn''t look good either, although, now I''m thinking maybe I should not have had such a high point of view, but lower my body a bit. I should try again.<br/>I wanted the title of the photo to be =, only =, just a graphic title like the image. But, the system needs an alphanumeric sign, so I had to add something that didn''t take away from the geometry, so ended up with this stupid latin title.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, votes and looking at this photo.I tried getting rid of the wall on the right, but then these two yellow things became too big, overwhelming the image. I didn''t want that. Vertical composition didn''t look good either, although, now I''m thinking maybe I should not have had such a high point of view, but lower my body a bit. I should try again.I wanted the title of the photo to be =, only =, just a graphic title like the image. But, the system needs an alphanumeric sign, so I had to add something that didn''t take away from the geometry, so ended up with this stupid latin title.', '2008-01-23 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415851, 633298, 61961, '<td valign="top">Terrific, Michelle!  I''m so proud of you.  On a flower shot, no less!<br/></td>', 'Terrific, Michelle!  I''m so proud of you.  On a flower shot, no less!', '2008-01-23 00:18:48.000000', NULL, 0),
