(4415889, 633259, 88219, '<td valign="top">China berries are yellow, this is the way they look in winter. I though i was a great shot, i didn''t think it would win, but I can see no reason for the 1''s and 2''s. Maybe the cropping could have been better, the lighting and focus are dead on, and it is yellow. I would love to hear why some of you thought i was "Bad".</td>', 'China berries are yellow, this is the way they look in winter. I though i was a great shot, i didn''t think it would win, but I can see no reason for the 1''s and 2''s. Maybe the cropping could have been better, the lighting and focus are dead on, and it is yellow. I would love to hear why some of you thought i was "Bad".', '2008-01-23 00:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
