(4416155, 633259, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a very difficult site sometimes, especially for newcomers.  Were I to have voted this in a challenge, I would have started with a 5, as it does indeed meet the challenge and is reasonably well exposed.  I can''t tell if it''s truly in focus or not but it''s not wickedly out of focus.  It appears yellow to me - but you can see from your comments that on some monitors it did not.  Voters here can be very, very specific and picky.  Your best bet, challenge-wise, is to hit the challenge as dead-on as you can.  I probably would not have increased my vote from a 5, though.  The photo doesn''t really say anything to me - if that makes sense.  It''s a close crop, which is OK, but it''s not especially well balanced - it''s just sitting there in the frame with an awkward amount of space around it.  There''s no context - while this sometimes will do well at DPC - ie a subject on a completely barren background, I prefer to have some sort of context involved.  Keep in mind that I vote the way I vote - I certainly don''t speak for the majority.</td>', 'This is a very difficult site sometimes, especially for newcomers.  Were I to have voted this in a challenge, I would have started with a 5, as it does indeed meet the challenge and is reasonably well exposed.  I can''t tell if it''s truly in focus or not but it''s not wickedly out of focus.  It appears yellow to me - but you can see from your comments that on some monitors it did not.  Voters here can be very, very specific and picky.  Your best bet, challenge-wise, is to hit the challenge as dead-on as you can.  I probably would not have increased my vote from a 5, though.  The photo doesn''t really say anything to me - if that makes sense.  It''s a close crop, which is OK, but it''s not especially well balanced - it''s just sitting there in the frame with an awkward amount of space around it.  There''s no context - while this sometimes will do well at DPC - ie a subject on a completely barren background, I prefer to have some sort of context involved.  Keep in mind that I vote the way I vote - I certainly don''t speak for the majority.', '2008-01-23 02:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
