(4416449, 633933, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaysonmc:</b></div><hr/><i> Another nice study of Yellow. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hahahaha we are on the same level here, I thought this was lovely! Great DOF, magnificent crop (enough to let me know what it is, nice balance I think betbween the dark misterious background and how much space the fish takes over the frame!) nice yellow too and I do love the sexy noise on it!</td>', 'Originally posted by jaysonmc: Another nice study of Yellow.  Hahahaha we are on the same level here, I thought this was lovely! Great DOF, magnificent crop (enough to let me know what it is, nice balance I think betbween the dark misterious background and how much space the fish takes over the frame!) nice yellow too and I do love the sexy noise on it!', '2008-01-23 05:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4416465, 633915, 82112, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all. Never imagined a photo of Post Its would be my first ribbon. Thrilled nonetheless!<br/> <br/>As I strive to improve as a photographer, I will look back on this challenge as the one that really opened my eyes to creative lighting, which obviously "makes" this photo.</td>', 'Thanks to all. Never imagined a photo of Post Its would be my first ribbon. Thrilled nonetheless! As I strive to improve as a photographer, I will look back on this challenge as the one that really opened my eyes to creative lighting, which obviously "makes" this photo.', '2008-01-23 05:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4416477, 632229, 44877, '<td valign="top">OMG OMG!!! You insane woman - you did it!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! This is outstanding! I am SO happy for you and very proud. They say that dragonflies are good luck - well this one really was... though luck had not much to do with it. You are such an exceptional photographer and this ribbon is a tribute to that!<br/> <br/>OXOX Alicia</td>', 'OMG OMG!!! You insane woman - you did it!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! This is outstanding! I am SO happy for you and very proud. They say that dragonflies are good luck - well this one really was... though luck had not much to do with it. You are such an exceptional photographer and this ribbon is a tribute to that! OXOX Alicia', '2008-01-23 05:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4416482, 633670, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow - this is amazing! I can''t believe that you made this whole thing. I looked at it for a while before I read your photographer''s comments. Love how you have a vision and then go about executing it. This is a wonderful photo and it is definitely underrated.</td>', 'Wow - this is amazing! I can''t believe that you made this whole thing. I looked at it for a while before I read your photographer''s comments. Love how you have a vision and then go about executing it. This is a wonderful photo and it is definitely underrated.', '2008-01-23 05:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
