(4416501, 633298, 68035, '<td valign="top">I think that people may on occasion be bored with flowers and so the fact that this scored so well is testament to what a great shot it is.  WOnderful composition and sharpness (you are doing better with your new macro lens than I am with mine) and you certainly could not say it did not meet the challenge<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the outstanding score and finish and well done on getting a new shot for your front page</td>', 'I think that people may on occasion be bored with flowers and so the fact that this scored so well is testament to what a great shot it is.  WOnderful composition and sharpness (you are doing better with your new macro lens than I am with mine) and you certainly could not say it did not meet the challenge Congratulations on the outstanding score and finish and well done on getting a new shot for your front page', '2008-01-23 06:01:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4416506, 633933, 44877, '<td valign="top">Aw man - I loved this photo during voting, though I already knew it wouldn''t appeal to the masses. Your title is really inspired, too. Great crop and grain - it''s very deep-sea-ish, yes, very subconscious. I commend you for submitting a photo you liked even if you knew it wouldn''t soar. As you can see by the 45 votes of 6 and above, some of us thought it''s pretty cool.</td>', 'Aw man - I loved this photo during voting, though I already knew it wouldn''t appeal to the masses. Your title is really inspired, too. Great crop and grain - it''s very deep-sea-ish, yes, very subconscious. I commend you for submitting a photo you liked even if you knew it wouldn''t soar. As you can see by the 45 votes of 6 and above, some of us thought it''s pretty cool.', '2008-01-23 06:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
