(4417135, 633298, 66384, '<td valign="top">Michelle, this is beautiful. Definitely not sick of flowers images when they are this lovely to look at. I love the DOF and the bokeh. And it''s an interesting choice to focus on the flower that is just opening rather than the fully opened ones I can see in the background. Congratulation on the new entry in your top row.</td>', 'Michelle, this is beautiful. Definitely not sick of flowers images when they are this lovely to look at. I love the DOF and the bokeh. And it''s an interesting choice to focus on the flower that is just opening rather than the fully opened ones I can see in the background. Congratulation on the new entry in your top row.', '2008-01-23 09:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4417143, 632906, 29011, '<td valign="top">Glad this placed so well. Very deserving top5. One my faves from the challenge. Quite the unique take on the theme, meant in a good way of course :) Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-23 09:57:03.</i></td>', 'Glad this placed so well. Very deserving top5. One my faves from the challenge. Quite the unique take on the theme, meant in a good way of course :) Congratulations!', '2008-01-23 09:56:11.000000', '2008-01-23 09:57:03.000000', 0),
