(4417736, 633298, 62318, '<td valign="top">I gave this a very high rating. I am surprised it did not hit top ten. What I liked about it:<br/>1) Focus and detail amazing<br/>2) Nice composition<br/>3) Since the theme was yellow, there is yellow everywhere!</td>', 'I gave this a very high rating. I am surprised it did not hit top ten. What I liked about it:1) Focus and detail amazing2) Nice composition3) Since the theme was yellow, there is yellow everywhere!', '2008-01-23 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4417754, 633259, 88219, '<td valign="top">Thank you, Melethia for your post at least there are some who have a system to their voting. I seems i me that the voting system could use some serious tweaking, I is difficult to judge all the photos and comment, as a judge I strongly believe that in the cast of voting one, two, and even 3 your owe the Photographer some kind of words direction. If it''s not your taste then past it by or give a four.</td>', 'Thank you, Melethia for your post at least there are some who have a system to their voting. I seems i me that the voting system could use some serious tweaking, I is difficult to judge all the photos and comment, as a judge I strongly believe that in the cast of voting one, two, and even 3 your owe the Photographer some kind of words direction. If it''s not your taste then past it by or give a four.', '2008-01-23 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4417765, 632229, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 1st-Blue for a Yellow.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 1st-Blue for a Yellow.', '2008-01-23 12:46:26.000000', NULL, 0),
