(4417805, 633402, 87387, '<td valign="top">on my screen the image looked fine, i guess i have a problem since so many had trouble seeing the glass. i agree that the lighting may be a bit harsh, but all i had was an overhead halogen light in my kitchen.<br/>thanks for all of the comments and votes.</td>', 'on my screen the image looked fine, i guess i have a problem since so many had trouble seeing the glass. i agree that the lighting may be a bit harsh, but all i had was an overhead halogen light in my kitchen.thanks for all of the comments and votes.', '2008-01-23 13:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
