(4419104, 633581, 31403, '<td valign="top">isn''t it interesting how the surface area of all three glasses goes so dark?  What part of the magic kitchen is that reflecting?  I''m trying to think it through but my only guess is it''s dark in your magic kitchen, and that''s the ceiling - do I get a prize?<br/> <br/>But if you put a white bounce or diffusion tent (commonly known as a white sheet) up there, do you mess up the cool reflection in the plexiglass/glass?<br/> <br/>Now I have something to ponder as I drive home this frigid night - maybe warm here by Germany standards, but -11 C is cold here!<br/> <br/>Oh no!  My clinical evaluation of your excellent photo has degraded into a personal message - whatever shall we do?<br/> <br/>I remain a fan.  :-)</td>', 'isn''t it interesting how the surface area of all three glasses goes so dark?  What part of the magic kitchen is that reflecting?  I''m trying to think it through but my only guess is it''s dark in your magic kitchen, and that''s the ceiling - do I get a prize? But if you put a white bounce or diffusion tent (commonly known as a white sheet) up there, do you mess up the cool reflection in the plexiglass/glass? Now I have something to ponder as I drive home this frigid night - maybe warm here by Germany standards, but -11 C is cold here! Oh no!  My clinical evaluation of your excellent photo has degraded into a personal message - whatever shall we do? I remain a fan.  :-)', '2008-01-23 19:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
