(4423973, 633805, 43073, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! I love it just as it is, with the story it tells, the almost humans playing in the background, your subject almost being pasted on top of this otherworldly scene, the isolation you''ve provided with light, color, distance. What a great abstraction thrown in as the background to what is otherwise pure practicality. Delightful! I''ve nominated you for an <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=714939" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">OOBIE</a>, great stuff!</td>', 'I love this photo! I love it just as it is, with the story it tells, the almost humans playing in the background, your subject almost being pasted on top of this otherworldly scene, the isolation you''ve provided with light, color, distance. What a great abstraction thrown in as the background to what is otherwise pure practicality. Delightful! I''ve nominated you for an OOBIE, great stuff!', '2008-01-25 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4424095, 633259, 49804, '<td valign="top">i''ll agree with Juliet here, by saying that it isn''t a bad shot, it is just a bit boring, maybe adding some color in the background, such as having something blue/purple to complement the main subject. I think this would add a lot to the shot and add some interest for the voters. Really though, it doesn''t need much, just adding a few things here and there.</td>', 'i''ll agree with Juliet here, by saying that it isn''t a bad shot, it is just a bit boring, maybe adding some color in the background, such as having something blue/purple to complement the main subject. I think this would add a lot to the shot and add some interest for the voters. Really though, it doesn''t need much, just adding a few things here and there.', '2008-01-25 11:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
