(4424466, 633259, 87808, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Greenman73:</b></div><hr/><i> Really, I didn''t think of it as being boring. T.Y. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am so sorry if I offended you, the way that you have replied makes you sound very defensive.  You say that you wanted some honest comments, I gave you my opinion and it appears as though you are taking offense to them.  This is not going to make people want to comment on your work, phrasing can come across so differently than when it is said in our heads.  Keep on shooting and good luck!</td>', 'Originally posted by Greenman73: Really, I didn''t think of it as being boring. T.Y.   I am so sorry if I offended you, the way that you have replied makes you sound very defensive.  You say that you wanted some honest comments, I gave you my opinion and it appears as though you are taking offense to them.  This is not going to make people want to comment on your work, phrasing can come across so differently than when it is said in our heads.  Keep on shooting and good luck!', '2008-01-25 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
