(4448266, 631638, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hi Serenety.  I like the flowers.  This is a good example of a shot that could really get some pop with not terribly much editing effort.  Even a minor "curves" adjustment would add contrast.<br/> <br/>Try your camera in aperture priority mode and play around with depth of field.  You can do some pretty amazing things with the lens wide open (which is the smallest F-stop).</td>', 'Hi Serenety.  I like the flowers.  This is a good example of a shot that could really get some pop with not terribly much editing effort.  Even a minor "curves" adjustment would add contrast. Try your camera in aperture priority mode and play around with depth of field.  You can do some pretty amazing things with the lens wide open (which is the smallest F-stop).', '2008-02-01 18:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
